    "strength_cluster and day_type are DERIVED from movement_pattern via movement_patterns.json — do not duplicate them here.",
    "measure: 'reps' (default) or 'seconds' for timed holds. loadable: false means weight never applies; progression is reps then sets (§5.2).",
